  "prefLabel": "Cor 411.02 Work Release Program Description",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 411.02 Work Release Program Description. The program shall provide guidance and jurisdiction over the resident while assisting them in completion of their program. Residents in the program shall be assigned to a departmental transitional housing unit, taking into consideration availability of employment, educational opportunities, public safety, public acceptance, and the desires of the resident.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Cor 400) #12887, eff 9-29-19",
